{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41606","headline":"题西林寺水阁 · 伍乔","name":"题西林寺水阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹翠苔花遶槛浓，此亭幽致讵曾逢。\n水分林下清泠派，山峙云间峭峻峰。\n怪石夜光寒射烛，老杉秋韵冷和钟。\n不知来往留题客，谁约重寻莲社踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伍乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}